    },
    {
      "key": "t8254c2ac10c38f48",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is the practical meaning behind terms such as lot size forex, forex lot size and trade volume. The lot does not tell you whether a position will gain or lose. It tells you how much market exposure the position represents.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">这是外汇手数、外汇交易手数和交易量等术语的实际含义。手数不会告诉您一个头寸会盈利还是亏损，而是告诉您该头寸代表多大的市场风险敞口。</span>"
    },
