    {
      "key": "t3b49cfd38f0f96ed",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Do You Calculate Lot Size in Forex?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如何计算外汇交易手数？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7375742be6427ea3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Forex lot size can be calculated by combining the amount a trader is prepared to risk with the stop-loss distance and the pip value of the position.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外汇手数可以通过将交易者准备承担风险的金额与止损距离和头寸的点值相结合来计算。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t390ca30562af90cf",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A simplified position-sizing process is:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">简化的头寸调整流程是：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb096395b9c7e6fe7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Define the stop-loss distance in pips.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">定义止损距离（以点为单位）。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7d576094054afc16",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Determine the pip value for 1.00 lot.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">确定 1.00 手的点值。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1a890bd5c4500c25",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Calculate the lot size that connects those values.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">计算连接这些值的手数。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9973999ab8fa2024",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lot Size = Risk Amount ÷ (Stop-Loss Distance × Pip Value per 1.00 Lot)</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">手数 = 风险金额 ÷（止损距离 × 每 1.00 手的点值）</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t446e27ade1d157d9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Simplified Worked Example</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">简化的计算示例</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0abf67335284976d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stop-loss distance: 50 pips</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">止损距离：50点</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t06e646371766af3d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Instrument: EUR/USD</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">工具：欧元/美元</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc35cf19be53e9f63",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Approximate pip value at 1.00 lot: $10 per pip</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1.00 手的近似点值：每点 10 美元</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t274cfb36adb2d78c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">$100 ÷ (50 × $10) = 0.20 lots</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">100 美元 ÷ (50 × 10 美元) = 0.20 手</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t961ed732193717ae",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Under those assumptions, 0.20 lots would make a 50-pip movement worth approximately $100.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">根据这些假设，0.20 手将使 50 点的变动价值约 100 美元。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t757a33f8ff82a74a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What's the Difference Between Lot Size and Leverage?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">手数和杠杆有什么区别？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc37caa7496d7cf28",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lot size measures the volume of the position, while </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">leverage</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> determines how much margin is required relative to that market exposure.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">手数衡量头寸的交易量，而</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">杠杆</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">决定相对于该市场风险敞口所需的保证金。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbc49720ebaadf48c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What changes with leverage is the amount of account equity generally required as </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">margin</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> to support that exposure.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">随杠杆变化的是通常需要的账户净值金额，作为支持该风险的</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">保证金</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9af2614163624f2f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lot Size</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">手数</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbb5bead8d4e78f54",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Position volume and exposure</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">头寸规模与市场风险敞口</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tff967c48c4cd26fc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Relationship between exposure and required margin</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">风险敞口与所需保证金之间的关系</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2048da6d3c4bae1f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Pip Value</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">点值</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9aae7b2eaa427228",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Monetary effect of a pip movement for the selected position size</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">点变动对所选头寸规模的货币影响</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta1a4f02b8cda511f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is the key distinction in the lot size vs leverage question.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">这是手数与杠杆问题的关键区别。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td8ccc3ee191a4e8c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Higher leverage does not transform a micro lot into a mini or standard lot. Likewise, reducing lot size does not change the leverage ratio itself.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">较高的杠杆率不会将微型手数转变为迷你手数或标准手数。同样，减少手数也不会改变杠杆率本身。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5972fb36d28380ce",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lot size describes how many lots are being traded, while </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">contract size</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> defines how many underlying units one full lot represents for that particular instrument.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">手数描述了正在交易的手数，而</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">合约大小</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">定义了一整手代表该特定工具的基础单位数量。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td8cbdbbe04ec80e2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Position Units = Number of Lots × Contract Size</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">持仓单位=手数×合约规模</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf4e0fedf0529a573",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For EUR/USD:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-read-a-forex-quote#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-read-a-forex-quote"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">欧元/美元：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te6d60e283309c9e8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The distinction becomes more important outside forex.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在外汇交易之外，这种区别变得更加重要。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1f36d1c47c0adfac",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Does Lot Size Affect Pip Value?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">手数大小如何影响点值？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1b99ac030fae6fdb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Pip value</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> increases or decreases directly with forex lot size, so larger positions experience a larger monetary change for the same pip movement.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">点值</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">随着外汇手数大小直接增加或减少，因此对于相同点的变动，较大的头寸会经历更大的货币变化。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8671db7bd8dac733",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For a major currency pair quoted in USD, such as EUR/USD, the approximate pip values are straightforward:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对于以美元报价的主要货币对（例如欧元/美元），近似点值非常简单：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3c7478ddd2733837",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Base-Currency Units</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">基础货币单位</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t95a05907bb68a20f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Approximate Pip Value</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">近似点值</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t803056b00fb32cee",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">1.00 Standard Lot</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-lot-size-in-forex#content",
